  "title": ".NET Developer Needed for Personal Task & Expense Management Web App",
  "fields": {
    "Zleceniodawca": "Ming Chen",
    "Opis": "I’m looking for a .NET developer to build a small personal web application for managing tasks and daily expenses. This is a private project intended for individual use, so the application should be simple, clean, responsive, and easy to maintain.\n\nThe developer should be comfortable working independently and delivering a complete working application with source code and basic setup documentation.",
    "Opublikowano": "wczoraj",
    "Kategoria": "Strony internetowe",
    "Prawa autorskie": "Decyzja freelancera",
    "Wymagane funkcje": "- ASP.NET Core / C#\n- User login and authentication\n- Add, edit, delete, and organize tasks\n- Add and categorize expenses\n- Monthly expense summary\n- Simple dashboard with basic statistics\n- Search and filtering\n- Responsive design for desktop and mobile\n- SQL Server or SQLite database\n- Export expense data to CSV\n- Basic validation and error handling",
    "Preferowane rozwiązanie": "I prefer an original solution using ASP.NET Core MVC or Blazor with C#. For the frontend, Bootstrap or another lightweight UI framework is fine.\n\nThe application does not need an overly complicated architecture. A straightforward .NET application with a relational database is preferred.",
    "Budżet": "2000,00 USD",
    "Ważne przez": "30 dni"
  },
